      "start": "00:00:02.200",
      "end": "00:00:03.890",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "bienvenido.\nPues<00:00:04.200><c> estamos</c><00:00:04.600><c> viendo</c><00:00:05.100><c> en</c><00:00:05.200><c> la</c><00:00:05.300><c> actualización</c>\n00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:05.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:03.900",
      "end": "00:00:05.890",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pues estamos viendo en la actualización\nde<00:00:06.000><c> bitcoin</c><00:00:06.400><c> hoy,</c><00:00:06.900><c> 5</c><00:00:07.400><c> de</c><00:00:07.500><c> noviembre.</c>\n00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:09.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:05.900",
      "end": "00:00:08.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de bitcoin hoy, 5 de noviembre.\nEn<00:00:09.100><c> este</c><00:00:09.200><c> momento</c><00:00:09.600><c> ya</c><00:00:09.800><c> son</c><00:00:10.000><c> las</c><00:00:10.700><c> eh</c><00:00:11.300><c> 7</c><00:00:11.900><c> y</c><00:00:12.200><c> 20</c><00:00:12.700><c> de</c>\n00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:09.000",
      "end": "00:00:12.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "En este momento ya son las eh 7 y 20 de\ncasi<00:00:13.300><c> 20</c><00:00:13.700><c> minutos</c><00:00:14.000><c> de</c><00:00:14.100><c> la</c><00:00:14.200><c> tarde,</c>\n00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:15.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:13.000",
      "end": "00:00:15.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "casi 20 minutos de la tarde,\nuna<00:00:15.500><c> horita</c><00:00:15.900><c> menos</c><00:00:16.100><c> en</c><00:00:16.200><c> Canarias,</c><00:00:16.600><c> donde</c><00:00:16.900><c> yo</c>\n00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:15.400",
      "end": "00:00:16.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "una horita menos en Canarias, donde yo\nresido.\n00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:18.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:17.000",
      "end": "00:00:18.190",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "resido.\nHoy<00:00:18.400><c> cuando</c>\n00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:18.200",
      "end": "00:00:19.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hoy cuando\nestaba<00:00:20.700><c> preparando</c><00:00:21.100><c> las</c><00:00:21.200><c> cosas</c><00:00:21.400><c> esta</c><00:00:21.600><c> tarde</c>\n00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:21.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:20.000",
      "end": "00:00:21.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estaba preparando las cosas esta tarde\ndije,<00:00:22.400><c> hoy</c><00:00:22.500><c> no</c><00:00:22.700><c> me</c><00:00:22.800><c> apetece</c><00:00:23.200><c> mucho</c><00:00:23.500><c> hacer</c><00:00:23.800><c> este</c>\n00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:24.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:21.800",
      "end": "00:00:24.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "dije, hoy no me apetece mucho hacer este\nel<00:00:24.600><c> segundo</c><00:00:25.000><c> vídeo,</c><00:00:25.600><c> en</c><00:00:25.700><c> fin,</c><00:00:26.400><c> pensé</c><00:00:26.700><c> que</c><00:00:26.800><c> iba</c>\n00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:26.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:24.400",
      "end": "00:00:26.890",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el segundo vídeo, en fin, pensé que iba\na<00:00:27.000><c> estar</c><00:00:27.800><c> como</c><00:00:28.000><c> lo</c><00:00:28.100><c> dejamos</c><00:00:28.400><c> metido</c><00:00:28.700><c> ahí</c><00:00:28.800><c> en</c><00:00:28.800><c> un</c>\n00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:28.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:26.900",
      "end": "00:00:28.890",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "a estar como lo dejamos metido ahí en un\nrango<00:00:29.200><c> apoyado,</c><00:00:29.700><c> yo</c><00:00:29.900><c> decía,</c><00:00:30.200><c> a</c><00:00:30.300><c> ver</c><00:00:30.500><c> quién</c>\n00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:31.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:28.900",
      "end": "00:00:31.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "rango apoyado, yo decía, a ver quién\nquién<00:00:31.900><c> le</c><00:00:32.000><c> da</c><00:00:32.200><c> a</c><00:00:32.200><c> las</c><00:00:32.400><c> pataditas</c><00:00:32.800><c> a</c><00:00:32.800><c> la</c><00:00:33.000><c> pelota,</c>\n00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:33.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:31.800",
      "end": "00:00:33.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "quién le da a las pataditas a la pelota,\nsi<00:00:33.500><c> alcistas</c><00:00:33.900><c> o</c><00:00:33.900><c> bajistas.</c><00:00:34.800><c> Bueno,</c><00:00:35.200><c> ¿quién</c><00:00:35.400><c> se</c>\n00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:35.500 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:33.300",
      "end": "00:00:35.490",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "si alcistas o bajistas. Bueno, ¿quién se\nla<00:00:35.600><c> ha</c><00:00:35.600><c> dado?</c>\n00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:36.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:35.500",
      "end": "00:00:36.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "la ha dado?\nYo<00:00:36.800><c> yo</c><00:00:36.900><c> pensé,</c><00:00:37.600><c> pues</c><00:00:37.700><c> no</c><00:00:37.900><c> voy</c><00:00:38.100><c> a</c><00:00:38.100><c> hacer</c><00:00:38.400><c> el</c>\n00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:38.500 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:36.700",
      "end": "00:00:38.490",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yo yo pensé, pues no voy a hacer el\nvídeo,<00:00:39.000><c> total</c><00:00:39.300><c> si</c><00:00:39.400><c> me</c><00:00:39.500><c> salto</c><00:00:39.800><c> uno</c><00:00:40.000><c> no</c><00:00:40.000><c> creo</c><00:00:40.200><c> que</c>\n00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:40.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:38.500",
      "end": "00:00:40.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vídeo, total si me salto uno no creo que\npase<00:00:40.600><c> nada,</c><00:00:41.100><c> pero</c><00:00:41.200><c> después</c><00:00:41.500><c> vi</c><00:00:41.700><c> cómo</c><00:00:41.900><c> estaba</c>\n00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:42.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:40.300",
      "end": "00:00:42.190",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pase nada, pero después vi cómo estaba\nel<00:00:42.400><c> precio</c><00:00:42.800><c> y</c><00:00:42.900><c> cómo</c><00:00:43.100><c> se</c><00:00:43.200><c> ha</c><00:00:43.300><c> movido</c><00:00:43.800><c> desde</c><00:00:44.100><c> qué</c>\n00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:44.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:42.200",
      "end": "00:00:44.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el precio y cómo se ha movido desde qué\nreferencias<00:00:44.800><c> que</c><00:00:44.900><c> enseguida</c><00:00:45.200><c> te</c><00:00:45.400><c> voy</c><00:00:45.500><c> a</c>\n00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:45.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:44.300",
      "end": "00:00:45.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "referencias que enseguida te voy a\ncontar.\n00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:46.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:45.600",
      "end": "00:00:46.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contar.\nDije,<00:00:46.900><c> pues</c><00:00:47.100><c> sí,</c><00:00:47.600><c> y</c><00:00:47.700><c> acabo</c><00:00:48.000><c> de</c><00:00:48.000><c> terminar</c><00:00:48.500><c> la</c><00:00:49.300><c> de</c>\n00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:49.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:46.800",
      "end": "00:00:49.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dije, pues sí, y acabo de terminar la de\nestar<00:00:49.600><c> con</c><00:00:49.700><c> los</c><00:00:49.800><c> alumnos</c><00:00:50.200><c> de</c><00:00:50.300><c> Crea</c><00:00:50.500><c> Traders</c>\n00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:50.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:49.400",
      "end": "00:00:50.890",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estar con los alumnos de Crea Traders\nque<00:00:51.000><c> hoy</c><00:00:51.100><c> tenían</c><00:00:51.300><c> su</c><00:00:51.500><c> primer</c><00:00:52.000><c> seminario</c>\n00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:53.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:50.900",
      "end": "00:00:53.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que hoy tenían su primer seminario\ny<00:00:53.500><c> no</c><00:00:53.600><c> he</c><00:00:53.600><c> querido</c><00:00:54.000><c> faltar,</c><00:00:54.300><c> así</c><00:00:54.500><c> que</c><00:00:54.600><c> vamos</c><00:00:54.800><c> a</c>\n00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:54.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:53.400",
      "end": "00:00:54.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y no he querido faltar, así que vamos a\ndedicarle<00:00:55.200><c> unos</c><00:00:55.300><c> minutitos.</c><00:00:55.800><c> Mira,</c><00:00:56.400><c> lo</c><00:00:56.600><c> que</c>\n00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:56.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:54.800",
      "end": "00:00:56.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "dedicarle unos minutitos. Mira, lo que\nha pasado<00:00:57.100><c> no</c><00:00:57.100><c> es</c><00:00:57.200><c> ninguna</c><00:00:57.500><c> sorpresa.</c><00:00:58.400><c> Yo</c><00:00:58.600><c> te</c>\n00:00:58.690 --> 00:00:58.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:56.700",
      "end": "00:00:58.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ha pasado no es ninguna sorpresa. Yo te\nhabía<00:00:58.900><c> estado</c><00:00:59.100><c> manteniendo</c><00:01:00.300><c> la</c><00:01:00.500><c> idea</c><00:01:00.800><c> igual</c>\n00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:01.100 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:58.700",
      "end": "00:01:01.090",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "había estado manteniendo la idea igual\nque<00:01:01.600><c> el</c><00:01:01.900><c> día</c><00:01:02.600><c> 21</c><00:01:03.000><c> de</c><00:01:03.100><c> octubre,</c><00:01:03.600><c> este</c><00:01:03.900><c> día</c><00:01:04.500><c> que</c>\n00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:04.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:01.100",
      "end": "00:01:04.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que el día 21 de octubre, este día que\ndejó<00:01:04.800><c> esta</c><00:01:05.000><c> señal</c><00:01:05.600><c> y</c><00:01:05.800><c> en</c><00:01:06.300><c> en</c><00:01:06.400><c> la</c><00:01:06.500><c> acción</c><00:01:06.700><c> del</c>\n00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:06.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:04.600",
      "end": "00:01:06.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "dejó esta señal y en en la acción del\nprecio<00:01:07.100><c> esta</c><00:01:07.300><c> señal</c><00:01:07.700><c> en</c><00:01:07.900><c> este</c><00:01:08.100><c> contexto,</c><00:01:08.800><c> no</c>\n00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:09.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:06.800",
      "end": "00:01:08.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio esta señal en este contexto, no\nen cualquiera,<00:01:09.500><c> sino</c><00:01:10.100><c> en</c><00:01:10.300><c> un</c><00:01:10.400><c> contexto</c>\n00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:11.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:09.000",
      "end": "00:01:11.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en cualquiera, sino en un contexto\ncorrectivo\n00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:12.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:11.300",
      "end": "00:01:12.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "correctivo\ndonde<00:01:12.900><c> los</c><00:01:13.000><c> máximos</c><00:01:13.400><c> y</c><00:01:13.400><c> los</c><00:01:13.500><c> mínimos</c><00:01:13.800><c> son</c>\n00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:14.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:12.700",
      "end": "00:01:13.990",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "donde los máximos y los mínimos son\ndecrecientes,<00:01:14.700><c> es</c><00:01:14.800><c> una</c><00:01:15.100><c> señal</c><00:01:15.600><c> de</c>\n00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:15.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:14.000",
      "end": "00:01:15.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "decrecientes, es una señal de\ncontinuidad<00:01:16.300><c> de</c><00:01:16.700><c> de</c><00:01:16.800><c> la</c><00:01:17.200><c> de</c><00:01:17.400><c> la</c><00:01:17.500><c> reversión,</c><00:01:18.100><c> de</c>\n00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:18.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:15.700",
      "end": "00:01:18.190",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "continuidad de de la de la reversión, de\nla<00:01:18.700><c> en</c><00:01:18.800><c> este</c><00:01:19.000><c> caso</c><00:01:19.700><c> de</c><00:01:19.800><c> esta</c><00:01:20.700><c> corrección.</c><00:01:21.500><c> Lo</c>\n00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:18.200",
      "end": "00:01:21.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "la en este caso de esta corrección. Lo\nque estábamos<00:01:22.000><c> viendo</c><00:01:22.500><c> ayer</c><00:01:22.900><c> no</c><00:01:23.100><c> era</c><00:01:23.200><c> otra</c>\n00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:23.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:21.600",
      "end": "00:01:23.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que estábamos viendo ayer no era otra\ncosa<00:01:23.800><c> que</c><00:01:24.400><c> el</c><00:01:24.600><c> mercado,</c><00:01:25.500><c> lo</c><00:01:25.700><c> vemos</c><00:01:25.900><c> ahora</c><00:01:26.100><c> en</c><00:01:26.200><c> 4</c>\n00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:26.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:23.400",
      "end": "00:01:26.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "cosa que el mercado, lo vemos ahora en 4\nhoras,<00:01:26.900><c> si</c><00:01:27.100><c> te</c><00:01:27.200><c> parece,</c><00:01:28.000><c> el</c><00:01:28.200><c> mercado</c><00:01:29.000><c> después</c>\n00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:29.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:26.600",
      "end": "00:01:29.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "horas, si te parece, el mercado después\nde<00:01:29.600><c> las</c><00:01:29.800><c> elecciones</c><00:01:30.200><c> de</c><00:01:30.300><c> medio</c><00:01:30.600><c> mandato</c><00:01:31.300><c> subió</c>\n00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:31.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:29.400",
      "end": "00:01:31.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de las elecciones de medio mandato subió\ntodo,<00:01:32.200><c> los</c><00:01:32.400><c> índices,</c><00:01:33.400><c> las</c><00:01:33.700><c> muchas</c><00:01:34.000><c> acciones,</c>\n00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:34.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:31.700",
      "end": "00:01:34.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "todo, los índices, las muchas acciones,\nel<00:01:35.000><c> SP</c><00:01:35.500><c> el</c><00:01:36.100><c> el</c><00:01:36.300><c> bitcoin,</c><00:01:37.100><c> el</c><00:01:37.400><c> el</c><00:01:37.600><c> oro,</c>\n00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:37.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:34.800",
      "end": "00:01:37.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el SP el el bitcoin, el el oro,\nethereum,\n00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:39.100 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:37.800",
      "end": "00:01:39.090",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ethereum,\npero<00:01:39.700><c> yo</c><00:01:40.000><c> te</c><00:01:40.100><c> decía</c><00:01:40.400><c> hasta</c><00:01:40.600><c> mañana,</c><00:01:41.000><c> lo</c><00:01:41.100><c> habían</c>\n00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:41.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:39.100",
      "end": "00:01:41.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pero yo te decía hasta mañana, lo habían\ndejado<00:01:41.600><c> aquí</c><00:01:41.800><c> apoyado,</c><00:01:42.500><c> lo</c><00:01:42.600><c> estamos</c><00:01:42.800><c> viendo</c>\n00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:43.100 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:41.300",
      "end": "00:01:43.090",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "dejado aquí apoyado, lo estamos viendo\nen<00:01:43.200><c> 4</c><00:01:43.500><c> horas,</c><00:01:43.700><c> lo</c><00:01:43.800><c> voy</c><00:01:43.900><c> a</c><00:01:43.900><c> llevar</c><00:01:44.300><c> a</c><00:01:44.500><c> 1</c><00:01:44.800><c> hora</c><00:01:45.300><c> y</c>\n00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:45.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:43.100",
      "end": "00:01:45.390",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en 4 horas, lo voy a llevar a 1 hora y\ndecía,<00:01:45.700><c> lo</c><00:01:45.800><c> han</c><00:01:45.900><c> dejado</c><00:01:46.300><c> ahí</c><00:01:46.600><c> refugiado</c><00:01:47.500><c> y</c>\n00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:47.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:45.400",
      "end": "00:01:47.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "decía, lo han dejado ahí refugiado y\nentonces<00:01:48.500><c> pues</c><00:01:48.600><c> ese</c><00:01:48.800><c> símil</c><00:01:49.200><c> con</c><00:01:49.400><c> la</c><00:01:49.400><c> pelota</c><00:01:49.800><c> de</c>\n00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:50.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:47.600",
      "end": "00:01:50.290",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "entonces pues ese símil con la pelota de\nde<00:01:50.500><c> fútbol</c><00:01:50.800><c> que</c><00:01:51.000><c> salía</c><00:01:51.200><c> en</c><00:01:51.300><c> la</c><00:01:51.400><c> miniatura,</c><00:01:52.500><c> yo</c>\n00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:52.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:50.300",
      "end": "00:01:52.690",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de fútbol que salía en la miniatura, yo\nlo<00:01:52.800><c> que</c><00:01:52.900><c> decía</c><00:01:53.300><c> es,</c><00:01:53.600><c> lo</c><00:01:53.700><c> han</c><00:01:53.800><c> dejado</c><00:01:54.200><c> ahí</c><00:01:54.600><c> en</c><00:01:54.800><c> un</c>\n00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:54.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:52.700",
      "end": "00:01:54.790",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "lo que decía es, lo han dejado ahí en un\ncontexto<00:01:55.800><c> que</c><00:01:55.900><c> es</c><00:01:56.000><c> bajista,</c><00:01:56.800><c> ¿verdad?</c><00:01:57.400><c> Pero</c><00:01:57.600><c> a</c>\n00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:57.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:54.800",
      "end": "00:01:57.590",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto que es bajista, ¿verdad? Pero a\nver<00:01:57.700><c> quién</c><00:01:57.900><c> movía</c><00:01:58.300><c> ficha,</c><00:01:58.700><c> a</c><00:01:58.800><c> ver</c><00:01:58.900><c> quién</c><00:01:59.200><c> le</c>\n00:01:59.190 --> 00:01:59.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:57.600",
      "end": "00:01:59.190",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ver quién movía ficha, a ver quién le\ndaba<00:01:59.400><c> la</c><00:01:59.892><c> al</c><00:01:59.992><c> balón,</c><00:02:00.592><c> si</c><00:02:00.692><c> los</c><00:02:00.892><c> alcistas</c><00:02:01.292><c> o</c><00:02:01.292><c> los</c>\n00:02:01.382 --> 00:02:01.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:59.200",
      "end": "00:02:01.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "daba la al balón, si los alcistas o los\nbajistas.<00:02:02.092><c> Y</c><00:02:02.292><c> no</c><00:02:02.392><c> picaron</c><00:02:02.792><c> los</c><00:02:02.892><c> alcistas.</c>\n00:02:03.482 --> 00:02:03.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:01.392",
      "end": "00:02:03.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "bajistas. Y no picaron los alcistas.\nBueno,<00:02:03.692><c> algunos</c><00:02:04.092><c> picaron.</c><00:02:04.892><c> De</c><00:02:04.992><c> hecho,</c><00:02:05.192><c> fíjate</c>\n00:02:05.482 --> 00:02:05.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:03.492",
      "end": "00:02:05.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bueno, algunos picaron. De hecho, fíjate\ncomo<00:02:05.692><c> subió</c><00:02:05.992><c> el</c><00:02:06.092><c> precio</c><00:02:06.892><c> y</c><00:02:07.092><c> este</c><00:02:07.292><c> precio</c><00:02:07.592><c> que</c>\n00:02:07.682 --> 00:02:07.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:05.492",
      "end": "00:02:07.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "como subió el precio y este precio que\nsube,<00:02:08.292><c> si</c><00:02:08.492><c> nosotros</c><00:02:08.892><c> lo</c><00:02:08.892><c> llevamos</c><00:02:09.192><c> al</c>\n00:02:09.282 --> 00:02:09.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:07.692",
      "end": "00:02:09.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "sube, si nosotros lo llevamos al\ncontexto<00:02:09.792><c> diario</c><00:02:10.292><c> es</c><00:02:10.392><c> este</c><00:02:10.592><c> máximo.</c><00:02:11.292><c> Si</c>\n00:02:11.382 --> 00:02:11.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:09.292",
      "end": "00:02:11.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto diario es este máximo. Si\nnosotros<00:02:11.792><c> trazamos</c><00:02:12.392><c> entre</c><00:02:12.692><c> el</c><00:02:12.792><c> primero,</c><00:02:13.192><c> que</c>\n00:02:13.282 --> 00:02:13.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:11.392",
      "end": "00:02:13.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "nosotros trazamos entre el primero, que\neste<00:02:13.392><c> es</c><00:02:13.492><c> muchas</c><00:02:13.692><c> veces</c><00:02:14.292><c> el</c><00:02:14.492><c> error,</c><00:02:15.192><c> lo</c><00:02:15.492><c> lo</c>\n00:02:15.582 --> 00:02:15.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:13.292",
      "end": "00:02:15.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "este es muchas veces el error, lo lo\ninteresante,<00:02:16.292><c> o</c><00:02:16.392><c> sea,</c><00:02:16.592><c> lo</c><00:02:16.892><c> todos</c><00:02:17.092><c> son</c>\n00:02:17.282 --> 00:02:17.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:15.592",
      "end": "00:02:17.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "interesante, o sea, lo todos son\nimportantes,<00:02:18.392><c> pero</c><00:02:18.792><c> si</c><00:02:18.892><c> nosotros</c><00:02:19.292><c> tomamos</c><00:02:19.892><c> el</c>\n00:02:20.082 --> 00:02:20.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:17.292",
      "end": "00:02:20.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "importantes, pero si nosotros tomamos el\nprimer<00:02:20.392><c> máximo</c><00:02:21.092><c> y</c><00:02:21.292><c> el</c><00:02:21.392><c> último</c><00:02:21.992><c> de</c><00:02:22.192><c> acción</c><00:02:22.492><c> del</c>\n00:02:22.582 --> 00:02:22.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:20.092",
      "end": "00:02:22.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "primer máximo y el último de acción del\nprecio,<00:02:22.992><c> que</c><00:02:23.492><c> esto</c><00:02:23.892><c> es</c><00:02:24.192><c> de</c><00:02:24.492><c> XTB</c><00:02:24.792><c> Trader,</c>\n00:02:26.082 --> 00:02:26.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:22.592",
      "end": "00:02:26.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio, que esto es de XTB Trader,\nvemos,<00:02:26.692><c> ¿no?</c>\n00:02:27.382 --> 00:02:27.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:26.092",
      "end": "00:02:27.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vemos, ¿no?\nPor<00:02:27.492><c> encima</c><00:02:27.892><c> salen</c><00:02:28.092><c> otros,</c><00:02:28.292><c> pero</c><00:02:28.492><c> si</c><00:02:28.692><c> trazamos</c>\n00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:29.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:27.392",
      "end": "00:02:29.182",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Por encima salen otros, pero si trazamos\nuna<00:02:29.292><c> línea</c><00:02:29.992><c> para</c><00:02:30.192><c> ver</c><00:02:30.292><c> esos</c><00:02:30.692><c> precios,</c><00:02:31.292><c> fíjate,</c>\n00:02:32.382 --> 00:02:32.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:29.192",
      "end": "00:02:32.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "una línea para ver esos precios, fíjate,\ny<00:02:32.492><c> eso</c><00:02:32.592><c> lo</c><00:02:32.692><c> teníamos</c><00:02:33.092><c> esta</c><00:02:33.292><c> mañana,</c><00:02:33.592><c> ahí</c><00:02:33.792><c> fue</c>\n00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:33.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:32.392",
      "end": "00:02:33.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y eso lo teníamos esta mañana, ahí fue\ndonde<00:02:34.192><c> frenó</c><00:02:34.592><c> ayer.</c><00:02:35.092><c> Ya</c><00:02:35.292><c> tenemos</c><00:02:35.492><c> el</c><00:02:35.592><c> primer</c>\n00:02:35.882 --> 00:02:35.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:33.892",
      "end": "00:02:35.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "donde frenó ayer. Ya tenemos el primer\ncontexto<00:02:36.892><c> de</c><00:02:37.092><c> por</c><00:02:37.292><c> qué</c><00:02:37.792><c> en</c><00:02:38.092><c> 4</c><00:02:38.492><c> horas</c><00:02:38.992><c> vemos</c><00:02:39.292><c> que</c>\n00:02:39.482 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:35.892",
      "end": "00:02:39.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto de por qué en 4 horas vemos que\nel precio<00:02:39.892><c> subió</c><00:02:40.192><c> hasta</c><00:02:40.392><c> ahí.</c><00:02:40.692><c> Pero</c><00:02:40.792><c> bueno,</c>\n00:02:40.982 --> 00:02:40.992 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:39.492",
      "end": "00:02:40.982",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el precio subió hasta ahí. Pero bueno,\nestaban<00:02:41.292><c> precios</c><00:02:41.592><c> vendedores,</c><00:02:41.992><c> lo</c><00:02:42.092><c> dejaron</c>\n00:02:42.382 --> 00:02:42.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:40.992",
      "end": "00:02:42.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estaban precios vendedores, lo dejaron\nestos<00:02:42.692><c> 80.308,</c><00:02:43.892><c> que</c><00:02:43.992><c> es</c><00:02:44.092><c> donde</c><00:02:44.292><c> yo</c><00:02:44.492><c> digo,</c><00:02:45.092><c> ahí</c>\n00:02:45.682 --> 00:02:45.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:42.392",
      "end": "00:02:45.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estos 80.308, que es donde yo digo, ahí\nes<00:02:45.992><c> donde</c><00:02:47.092><c> notablemente</c><00:02:47.792><c> puede</c><00:02:47.992><c> entrar</c><00:02:48.592><c> la</c>\n00:02:49.082 --> 00:02:49.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:45.692",
      "end": "00:02:49.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "es donde notablemente puede entrar la\naumenta<00:02:49.592><c> la</c><00:02:49.692><c> presión</c><00:02:50.092><c> bajista.</c><00:02:50.792><c> ¿Qué</c><00:02:50.892><c> ha</c>\n00:02:50.882 --> 00:02:50.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:49.092",
      "end": "00:02:50.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "aumenta la presión bajista. ¿Qué ha\npasado?<00:02:51.692><c> Que</c><00:02:51.792><c> abrió</c><00:02:52.292><c> Nueva</c><00:02:52.492><c> York,</c><00:02:53.092><c> siempre</c>\n00:02:53.382 --> 00:02:53.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:50.892",
      "end": "00:02:53.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pasado? Que abrió Nueva York, siempre\ntenemos<00:02:53.692><c> que</c><00:02:53.792><c> esperar</c><00:02:54.092><c> a</c><00:02:54.092><c> esa</c><00:02:54.292><c> sesión,</c><00:02:54.592><c> no</c>\n00:02:54.982 --> 00:02:54.992 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:53.392",
      "end": "00:02:54.982",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tenemos que esperar a esa sesión, no\ntomar<00:02:55.292><c> decisiones</c><00:02:56.092><c> antes</c><00:02:56.292><c> de</c><00:02:56.392><c> ver</c><00:02:56.692><c> el</c><00:02:56.792><c> momento</c>\n00:02:57.282 --> 00:02:57.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:54.992",
      "end": "00:02:57.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tomar decisiones antes de ver el momento\ndel<00:02:57.492><c> mercado</c><00:02:57.792><c> más</c><00:02:57.992><c> líquido</c><00:02:58.392><c> y</c><00:02:58.492><c> mira</c><00:02:58.692><c> lo</c><00:02:58.792><c> que</c>\n00:02:58.882 --> 00:02:58.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:57.292",
      "end": "00:02:58.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "del mercado más líquido y mira lo que\nocurre<00:02:59.092><c> a</c><00:02:59.192><c> partir</c><00:02:59.492><c> de</c><00:02:59.592><c> esa</c><00:02:59.792><c> hora.</c><00:03:00.192><c> Justo</c><00:03:00.392><c> ahí</c>\n00:03:00.582 --> 00:03:00.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:58.892",
      "end": "00:03:00.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ocurre a partir de esa hora. Justo ahí\ntenemos<00:03:01.092><c> cómo</c><00:03:01.392><c> empieza</c><00:03:01.692><c> a</c><00:03:01.792><c> caer</c><00:03:01.992><c> el</c><00:03:02.192><c> precio.</c>\n00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:02.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:00.592",
      "end": "00:03:02.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tenemos cómo empieza a caer el precio.\nSe<00:03:02.592><c> empezaban</c><00:03:02.992><c> a</c><00:03:03.092><c> publicar</c><00:03:03.492><c> datos</c><00:03:03.892><c> también.</c>\n00:03:04.182 --> 00:03:04.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:02.492",
      "end": "00:03:04.182",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Se empezaban a publicar datos también.\nMañana<00:03:04.492><c> tenemos</c><00:03:04.792><c> nóminas</c><00:03:05.192><c> no</c><00:03:05.292><c> agrícolas.</c><00:03:06.292><c> Se</c>\n00:03:06.382 --> 00:03:06.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:04.192",
      "end": "00:03:06.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mañana tenemos nóminas no agrícolas. Se\nhabían<00:03:06.592><c> completado</c><00:03:07.392><c> dos</c><00:03:07.692><c> objetivos,</c><00:03:08.292><c> 75.580,</c>\n00:03:09.682 --> 00:03:09.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:06.392",
      "end": "00:03:09.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "habían completado dos objetivos, 75.580,\n76.000<00:03:10.592><c> ese</c><00:03:10.892><c> de</c><00:03:11.292><c> 76.853,</c>\n00:03:14.082 --> 00:03:14.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:09.692",
      "end": "00:03:14.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "76.000 ese de 76.853,\n73.397<00:03:15.492><c> no</c><00:03:15.592><c> se</c><00:03:15.692><c> había</c><00:03:15.792><c> conseguido</c><00:03:16.492><c> y</c><00:03:16.692><c> ese</c>\n00:03:17.082 --> 00:03:17.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:14.092",
      "end": "00:03:17.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "73.397 no se había conseguido y ese\npuede<00:03:17.292><c> empujar</c><00:03:17.692><c> al</c><00:03:17.792><c> precio</c><00:03:18.192><c> hasta</c><00:03:18.392><c> la</c><00:03:18.592><c> zona,</c>\n00:03:19.082 --> 00:03:19.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:17.092",
      "end": "00:03:19.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "puede empujar al precio hasta la zona,\nentonces,<00:03:19.392><c> que</c><00:03:19.492><c> teníamos</c><00:03:19.992><c> marcada</c><00:03:20.492><c> de</c>\n00:03:20.682 --> 00:03:20.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:19.092",
      "end": "00:03:20.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "entonces, que teníamos marcada de\ncompras<00:03:21.292><c> aquí</c><00:03:21.592><c> en</c><00:03:21.692><c> el</c><00:03:21.892><c> gráfico</c><00:03:22.392><c> diario.</c><00:03:23.192><c> Y</c>\n00:03:23.282 --> 00:03:23.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:20.692",
      "end": "00:03:23.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "compras aquí en el gráfico diario. Y\nahora,<00:03:23.892><c> el</c><00:03:24.092><c> otro</c><00:03:24.692><c> el</c><00:03:24.892><c> otro</c><00:03:25.092><c> punto</c><00:03:25.392><c> interesante</c>\n00:03:26.282 --> 00:03:26.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:23.292",
      "end": "00:03:26.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ahora, el otro el otro punto interesante\nes<00:03:26.492><c> el</c><00:03:26.692><c> mínimo</c><00:03:27.092><c> de</c><00:03:27.192><c> hoy.</c><00:03:27.692><c> El</c><00:03:27.792><c> mínimo</c><00:03:28.192><c> de</c><00:03:28.292><c> hoy</c>\n00:03:28.482 --> 00:03:28.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:26.292",
      "end": "00:03:28.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "es el mínimo de hoy. El mínimo de hoy\nfrena<00:03:28.892><c> exactamente</c><00:03:29.892><c> en</c><00:03:30.092><c> este</c><00:03:30.292><c> precio</c>\n00:03:31.082 --> 00:03:31.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:28.492",
      "end": "00:03:31.082",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "frena exactamente en este precio\ncalculado,<00:03:31.592><c> los</c><00:03:31.692><c> 75.518.</c>\n00:03:33.582 --> 00:03:33.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:31.092",
      "end": "00:03:33.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "calculado, los 75.518.\n¿Ves<00:03:33.992><c> la</c><00:03:34.192><c> diferencia?</c><00:03:35.092><c> Es</c><00:03:35.192><c> decir,</c><00:03:35.692><c> justo</c><00:03:36.092><c> el</c>\n00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:36.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:33.592",
      "end": "00:03:36.182",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "¿Ves la diferencia? Es decir, justo el\nprecio<00:03:36.492><c> de</c><00:03:36.592><c> compras</c><00:03:37.092><c> que</c><00:03:37.592><c> ayer</c><00:03:37.992><c> no</c><00:03:38.192><c> tocó,</c><00:03:38.492><c> que</c>\n00:03:38.682 --> 00:03:38.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:36.192",
      "end": "00:03:38.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio de compras que ayer no tocó, que\nfaltaron<00:03:39.592><c> unos</c><00:03:39.792><c> dólares,</c><00:03:40.192><c> que</c><00:03:40.292><c> te</c><00:03:40.392><c> decía,</c>\n00:03:40.682 --> 00:03:40.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:38.692",
      "end": "00:03:40.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "faltaron unos dólares, que te decía,\naquí<00:03:40.892><c> faltaron</c><00:03:41.292><c> unos</c><00:03:41.492><c> dólares,</c><00:03:42.092><c> no</c><00:03:42.192><c> fue</c>\n00:03:42.382 --> 00:03:42.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:40.692",
      "end": "00:03:42.382",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "aquí faltaron unos dólares, no fue\ntocado,<00:03:42.792><c> hoy</c><00:03:43.092><c> sí.</c><00:03:43.492><c> Ha</c><00:03:43.592><c> venido</c><00:03:43.992><c> desde</c><00:03:44.392><c> el</c>\n00:03:44.482 --> 00:03:44.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:42.392",
      "end": "00:03:44.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tocado, hoy sí. Ha venido desde el\ncontexto<00:03:45.192><c> de</c><00:03:45.492><c> esa</c>\n00:03:46.682 --> 00:03:46.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:44.492",
      "end": "00:03:46.682",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto de esa\nlínea.<00:03:47.692><c> A</c><00:03:47.792><c> mí</c><00:03:47.792><c> no</c><00:03:47.892><c> me</c><00:03:47.992><c> gusta</c><00:03:48.292><c> trazar</c>\n00:03:48.582 --> 00:03:48.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:46.692",
      "end": "00:03:48.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "línea. A mí no me gusta trazar\ndirectrices,<00:03:49.192><c> pero</c><00:03:49.292><c> en</c><00:03:49.392><c> este</c><00:03:49.492><c> caso</c><00:03:49.792><c> era</c>\n00:03:49.882 --> 00:03:49.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:48.592",
      "end": "00:03:49.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "directrices, pero en este caso era\nimportante,<00:03:50.392><c> por</c><00:03:50.592><c> eso</c><00:03:50.792><c> lo</c><00:03:50.892><c> hice.</c><00:03:51.292><c> Verás</c><00:03:51.492><c> que</c>\n00:03:51.582 --> 00:03:51.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:49.892",
      "end": "00:03:51.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "importante, por eso lo hice. Verás que\nnormalmente<00:03:51.992><c> no</c><00:03:52.092><c> las</c><00:03:52.192><c> tengo.</c><00:03:52.892><c> Hasta</c><00:03:53.092><c> este</c>\n00:03:53.282 --> 00:03:53.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:51.592",
      "end": "00:03:53.282",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "normalmente no las tengo. Hasta este\nnivel.<00:03:53.492><c> Y</c><00:03:53.592><c> ahí</c><00:03:54.192><c> ahí</c><00:03:54.492><c> han</c><00:03:54.592><c> aprovechado</c><00:03:55.192><c> para</c>\n00:03:55.482 --> 00:03:55.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:53.292",
      "end": "00:03:55.482",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "nivel. Y ahí ahí han aprovechado para\ncerrar<00:03:55.892><c> posiciones</c><00:03:56.392><c> de</c><00:03:56.492><c> ventas</c><00:03:56.792><c> en</c><00:03:56.892><c> corto.</c><00:03:57.492><c> A</c>\n00:03:57.582 --> 00:03:57.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:55.492",
      "end": "00:03:57.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "cerrar posiciones de ventas en corto. A\nlo<00:03:57.692><c> mejor</c><00:03:57.892><c> si</c><00:03:57.992><c> lo</c><00:03:58.092><c> llevamos</c><00:03:58.392><c> a</c><00:03:58.392><c> intradía,</c><00:03:59.292><c> como</c>\n00:03:59.582 --> 00:03:59.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:57.592",
      "end": "00:03:59.582",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "lo mejor si lo llevamos a intradía, como\nhoy<00:03:59.692><c> habíamos</c><00:04:00.092><c> visto</c><00:04:00.392><c> cómo</c><00:04:00.592><c> era</c><00:04:00.792><c> la</c>\n00:04:00.882 --> 00:04:00.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:59.592",
      "end": "00:04:00.882",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hoy habíamos visto cómo era la\nnegociación<00:04:01.392><c> intradía,</c><00:04:02.292><c> vamos</c><00:04:02.592><c> a</c><00:04:02.592><c> ver</c><00:04:03.092><c> cuál</c>\n00:04:03.284 --> 00:04:03.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:00.892",
      "end": "00:04:03.284",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "negociación intradía, vamos a ver cuál\nel<00:04:03.394><c> último</c><00:04:03.794><c> nivel</c><00:04:03.994><c> que</c><00:04:04.094><c> teníamos</c><00:04:04.494><c> y</c><00:04:04.594><c> lo</c><00:04:04.694><c> que</c><00:04:04.794><c> ha</c>\n00:04:04.784 --> 00:04:04.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:03.294",
      "end": "00:04:04.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el último nivel que teníamos y lo que ha\nocurrido.<00:04:05.494><c> Vale,</c><00:04:05.694><c> pues</c><00:04:05.894><c> ya</c><00:04:05.894><c> vemos</c><00:04:06.194><c> que</c><00:04:06.294><c> se</c><00:04:06.394><c> ha</c>\n00:04:06.384 --> 00:04:06.394 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:04.794",
      "end": "00:04:06.384",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ocurrido. Vale, pues ya vemos que se ha\nido<00:04:06.594><c> negociando.</c><00:04:07.394><c> El</c><00:04:07.594><c> último</c><00:04:07.894><c> nivel,</c><00:04:08.494><c> lo</c>\n00:04:08.584 --> 00:04:08.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:06.394",
      "end": "00:04:08.584",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ido negociando. El último nivel, lo\nestamos<00:04:08.894><c> viendo</c><00:04:09.094><c> en</c><00:04:09.194><c> 5</c><00:04:09.494><c> minutos,</c><00:04:09.994><c> es</c><00:04:10.094><c> que</c><00:04:10.594><c> con</c>\n00:04:10.784 --> 00:04:10.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:08.594",
      "end": "00:04:10.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estamos viendo en 5 minutos, es que con\ntoda<00:04:11.094><c> esa</c><00:04:11.194><c> caída</c><00:04:11.794><c> fueron</c><00:04:12.094><c> negociando</c><00:04:12.494><c> el</c>\n00:04:12.584 --> 00:04:12.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:10.794",
      "end": "00:04:12.584",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "toda esa caída fueron negociando el\nresto<00:04:13.094><c> y</c><00:04:13.194><c> en</c><00:04:13.294><c> esta</c><00:04:13.594><c> lo</c><00:04:13.794><c> rompieron</c><00:04:14.594><c> y</c><00:04:14.694><c> están</c>\n00:04:14.884 --> 00:04:14.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:12.594",
      "end": "00:04:14.884",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "resto y en esta lo rompieron y están\nyendo<00:04:15.494><c> hacia</c><00:04:15.794><c> la</c><00:04:15.894><c> Bueno,</c><00:04:16.294><c> los</c><00:04:16.394><c> 75.000</c><00:04:17.394><c> es</c><00:04:17.594><c> este</c>\n00:04:17.784 --> 00:04:17.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:14.894",
      "end": "00:04:17.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "yendo hacia la Bueno, los 75.000 es este\nprecio\n00:04:18.784 --> 00:04:18.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:17.794",
      "end": "00:04:18.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio\ny<00:04:18.894><c> por</c><00:04:18.994><c> debajo</c><00:04:19.294><c> tenemos</c><00:04:19.694><c> estos</c><00:04:19.894><c> otros.</c>\n00:04:20.384 --> 00:04:20.394 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:18.794",
      "end": "00:04:20.384",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y por debajo tenemos estos otros.\nEntonces,<00:04:21.194><c> por</c><00:04:21.294><c> eso</c><00:04:21.494><c> yo</c><00:04:21.694><c> comentaba</c><00:04:22.494><c> en</c><00:04:22.594><c> este</c>\n00:04:22.684 --> 00:04:22.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:20.394",
      "end": "00:04:22.684",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entonces, por eso yo comentaba en este\nvídeo<00:04:22.894><c> de</c><00:04:22.894><c> actualización,</c><00:04:23.394><c> lo</c><00:04:23.494><c> quiero</c><00:04:23.694><c> dejar</c>\n00:04:23.884 --> 00:04:23.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:22.694",
      "end": "00:04:23.884",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vídeo de actualización, lo quiero dejar\nclaro,<00:04:24.194><c> mañana</c><00:04:24.494><c> continuamos,</c>\n00:04:25.784 --> 00:04:25.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:23.894",
      "end": "00:04:25.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "claro, mañana continuamos,\neh<00:04:26.294><c> comentaba</c><00:04:26.994><c> que</c><00:04:27.094><c> yo</c><00:04:27.194><c> no</c><00:04:27.294><c> tenía</c><00:04:27.494><c> ningún</c><00:04:27.894><c> plan</c>\n00:04:28.084 --> 00:04:28.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:25.794",
      "end": "00:04:28.084",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "eh comentaba que yo no tenía ningún plan\nen<00:04:28.194><c> esta</c><00:04:28.394><c> zona,</c><00:04:28.694><c> para</c><00:04:28.894><c> mí</c><00:04:28.994><c> era</c><00:04:29.194><c> neutral.</c><00:04:29.894><c> ¿Por</c>\n00:04:30.084 --> 00:04:30.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:28.094",
      "end": "00:04:30.084",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en esta zona, para mí era neutral. ¿Por\nqué?<00:04:30.194><c> Porque</c><00:04:30.694><c> no</c><00:04:30.894><c> tenía</c><00:04:31.294><c> máximos,</c><00:04:31.994><c> no</c><00:04:32.194><c> tenía</c>\n00:04:32.484 --> 00:04:32.494 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:30.094",
      "end": "00:04:32.484",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "qué? Porque no tenía máximos, no tenía\nmínimos<00:04:33.194><c> crecientes,</c><00:04:33.894><c> no</c><00:04:33.994><c> había</c><00:04:34.294><c> reversión,</c>\n00:04:34.884 --> 00:04:34.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:32.494",
      "end": "00:04:34.884",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "mínimos crecientes, no había reversión,\nyo<00:04:34.994><c> no</c><00:04:35.094><c> había</c><00:04:35.294><c> visto</c><00:04:35.594><c> nada.</c><00:04:36.194><c> Era</c><00:04:36.694><c> lo</c><00:04:36.894><c> primero</c>\n00:04:38.484 --> 00:04:38.494 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:34.894",
      "end": "00:04:38.484",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "yo no había visto nada. Era lo primero\ny<00:04:38.594><c> tendría</c><00:04:38.994><c> que</c><00:04:39.094><c> irse</c><00:04:39.294><c> confirmando</c><00:04:39.894><c> al</c><00:04:39.994><c> menos</c>\n00:04:40.284 --> 00:04:40.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:38.494",
      "end": "00:04:40.284",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y tendría que irse confirmando al menos\ncon<00:04:40.794><c> una</c><00:04:41.094><c> semanita,</c><00:04:41.694><c> con</c><00:04:42.094><c> dos</c><00:04:42.494><c> días,</c><00:04:42.894><c> con</c><00:04:43.094><c> lo</c>\n00:04:43.184 --> 00:04:43.194 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:40.294",
      "end": "00:04:43.184",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "con una semanita, con dos días, con lo\nque<00:04:43.294><c> sea,</c><00:04:43.894><c> depende</c><00:04:44.194><c> de</c><00:04:44.294><c> cómo</c><00:04:44.494><c> uno</c><00:04:44.594><c> tenga</c><00:04:45.094><c> ese</c>\n00:04:45.284 --> 00:04:45.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:43.194",
      "end": "00:04:45.284",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que sea, depende de cómo uno tenga ese\ncontexto<00:04:45.994><c> de</c><00:04:46.394><c> reversión.</c><00:04:47.294><c> Y</c><00:04:47.494><c> no</c><00:04:47.594><c> me</c><00:04:47.694><c> importa</c>\n00:04:47.984 --> 00:04:47.994 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:45.294",
      "end": "00:04:47.984",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto de reversión. Y no me importa\ncomprar<00:04:48.394><c> más</c><00:04:48.594><c> arriba</c><00:04:49.094><c> siempre</c><00:04:49.594><c> y</c><00:04:49.694><c> cuando</c><00:04:50.394><c> yo</c>\n00:04:50.584 --> 00:04:50.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:47.994",
      "end": "00:04:50.584",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
