      "start": "00:04:50.594",
      "end": "00:04:53.084",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vea que el mercado ha cambiado esa\ntendencia<00:04:53.594><c> y</c><00:04:53.694><c> si</c><00:04:53.794><c> la</c><00:04:53.894><c> tendencia</c><00:04:54.294><c> es</c><00:04:54.394><c> tu</c><00:04:54.494><c> amiga,</c>\n00:04:55.084 --> 00:04:55.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:53.094",
      "end": "00:04:55.084",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tendencia y si la tendencia es tu amiga,\nle<00:04:55.194><c> decía</c><00:04:55.494><c> hoy</c><00:04:55.694><c> a</c><00:04:55.794><c> los</c><00:04:55.994><c> compañeros,</c><00:04:56.594><c> a</c><00:04:56.694><c> los</c>\n00:04:56.784 --> 00:04:56.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:55.094",
      "end": "00:04:56.784",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "le decía hoy a los compañeros, a los\nalumnos<00:04:57.294><c> nuevos,</c><00:04:57.994><c> la</c><00:04:58.094><c> tendencia</c><00:04:58.594><c> es</c><00:04:58.594><c> alcista,</c>\n00:04:58.984 --> 00:04:58.994 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:56.794",
      "end": "00:04:58.984",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "alumnos nuevos, la tendencia es alcista,\nla<00:04:59.094><c> de</c><00:04:59.294><c> fondo,</c><00:04:59.594><c> pero</c><00:04:59.694><c> está</c><00:04:59.894><c> en</c><00:04:59.994><c> un</c><00:05:00.094><c> momento</c>\n00:05:00.384 --> 00:05:00.394 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:58.994",
      "end": "00:05:00.384",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "la de fondo, pero está en un momento\ncorrectivo.<00:05:01.094><c> Entonces,</c><00:05:01.294><c> no</c><00:05:01.394><c> tenía</c><00:05:01.694><c> plan.</c><00:05:02.194><c> Sin</c>\n00:05:02.284 --> 00:05:02.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:05:00.394",
      "end": "00:05:02.284",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "correctivo. Entonces, no tenía plan. Sin\nembargo,<00:05:02.694><c> aquí</c><00:05:02.894><c> abajo</c><00:05:03.494><c> ya</c><00:05:03.594><c> tengo</c><00:05:03.894><c> plan.</c><00:05:04.294><c> Si</c>\n00:05:04.384 --> 00:05:04.394 align:start position:0%",
