      "text": "actuar con mayor probabilidad. Si los\ntengo<00:05:25.194><c> tan</c><00:05:25.294><c> cerca</c><00:05:25.894><c> ni</c><00:05:26.094><c> se</c><00:05:26.194><c> me</c><00:05:26.294><c> ocurre</c><00:05:26.594><c> comprar.</c>\n00:05:27.184 --> 00:05:27.194 align:start position:0%",
