      "end": "00:05:42.584",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "bajando\nes<00:05:42.694><c> lo</c><00:05:42.794><c> que</c><00:05:42.894><c> está</c><00:05:43.594><c> ahora</c><00:05:43.894><c> mismo</c><00:05:44.594><c> funcionando.</c>\n00:05:45.884 --> 00:05:45.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:05:42.594",
      "end": "00:05:45.884",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "es lo que está ahora mismo funcionando.\nY<00:05:45.994><c> así</c><00:05:46.094><c> lo</c><00:05:46.294><c> vamos</c><00:05:46.494><c> haciendo</c><00:05:47.194><c> cada</c><00:05:47.394><c> día.</c><00:05:48.094><c> No</c>\n00:05:48.184 --> 00:05:48.194 align:start position:0%",
