      "start": "00:05:59.694",
      "end": "00:06:01.884",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "por arriba y pum. Y están Estaba\nempezando<00:06:02.294><c> a</c><00:06:02.394><c> estar</c><00:06:02.894><c> mejor</c><00:06:03.094><c> que</c><00:06:03.294><c> bitcoin</c><00:06:03.594><c> en</c>\n00:06:03.584 --> 00:06:03.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:01.894",
      "end": "00:06:03.584",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "empezando a estar mejor que bitcoin en\nzona<00:06:03.794><c> de</c><00:06:03.894><c> compras,</c><00:06:04.294><c> pero</c><00:06:04.494><c> todavía,</c><00:06:05.195><c> desde</c><00:06:05.395><c> mi</c>\n00:06:05.485 --> 00:06:05.495 align:start position:0%",
