      "end": "00:06:12.985",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "está en zona de tres precios calculados\nque<00:06:13.395><c> posibilitarán</c><00:06:14.195><c> la</c><00:06:14.295><c> subida.</c>\n00:06:15.185 --> 00:06:15.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:12.995",
      "end": "00:06:15.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que posibilitarán la subida.\nIncluso<00:06:15.595><c> le</c><00:06:15.695><c> ha</c><00:06:15.695><c> pasado</c><00:06:16.095><c> al</c><00:06:16.095><c> oro,</c><00:06:16.595><c> que</c><00:06:16.695><c> el</c><00:06:16.795><c> oro</c>\n00:06:17.085 --> 00:06:17.095 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:15.195",
      "end": "00:06:17.085",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Incluso le ha pasado al oro, que el oro\nhoy,<00:06:17.595><c> después</c><00:06:17.895><c> de</c><00:06:17.995><c> ese</c><00:06:18.195><c> rebote</c><00:06:18.495><c> aquí,</c><00:06:18.995><c> sí</c><00:06:19.195><c> que</c>\n00:06:19.285 --> 00:06:19.295 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:17.095",
      "end": "00:06:19.285",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hoy, después de ese rebote aquí, sí que\nhan<00:06:19.395><c> habido</c><00:06:19.695><c> compras,</c><00:06:20.095><c> aquí</c><00:06:20.295><c> parece</c><00:06:20.595><c> una</c>\n00:06:20.785 --> 00:06:20.795 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:19.295",
      "end": "00:06:20.785",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "han habido compras, aquí parece una\nreversión,<00:06:21.595><c> pero</c><00:06:21.795><c> mira</c><00:06:22.095><c> hoy.</c><00:06:22.595><c> Si</c><00:06:22.695><c> yo</c><00:06:23.195><c> hago</c><00:06:23.695><c> un</c>\n00:06:24.185 --> 00:06:24.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:20.795",
      "end": "00:06:24.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "reversión, pero mira hoy. Si yo hago un\ntrazo,<00:06:24.695><c> una</c><00:06:24.895><c> línea</c><00:06:25.295><c> entre</c><00:06:25.595><c> el</c><00:06:25.695><c> primer</c><00:06:26.395><c> y</c><00:06:26.595><c> el</c>\n00:06:26.885 --> 00:06:26.895 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:24.195",
      "end": "00:06:26.885",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "trazo, una línea entre el primer y el\núltimo<00:06:27.995><c> pivot</c><00:06:28.295><c> que</c><00:06:28.495><c> tengo,</c><00:06:28.995><c> que</c><00:06:29.095><c> está</c><00:06:29.295><c> muy</c>\n00:06:29.485 --> 00:06:29.495 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:26.895",
      "end": "00:06:29.485",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "último pivot que tengo, que está muy\ncercano,<00:06:30.095><c> vemos</c><00:06:30.295><c> que</c><00:06:30.395><c> parece</c><00:06:30.695><c> que</c><00:06:30.795><c> se</c><00:06:30.895><c> está</c>\n00:06:31.185 --> 00:06:31.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:29.495",
      "end": "00:06:31.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "cercano, vemos que parece que se está\nrompiendo<00:06:31.895><c> eso.</c><00:06:32.295><c> Sin</c><00:06:32.495><c> embargo,</c>\n00:06:33.485 --> 00:06:33.495 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:31.195",
      "end": "00:06:33.485",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "rompiendo eso. Sin embargo,\nsi<00:06:33.695><c> lo</c><00:06:33.795><c> voy</c><00:06:33.895><c> trazando</c><00:06:34.395><c> con</c><00:06:34.895><c> con</c><00:06:35.095><c> otros,</c><00:06:35.695><c> pues</c>\n00:06:35.785 --> 00:06:35.795 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:33.495",
      "end": "00:06:35.785",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "si lo voy trazando con con otros, pues\nvemos<00:06:36.095><c> ya</c><00:06:36.495><c> que</c><00:06:36.595><c> la</c><00:06:36.695><c> cosa</c><00:06:36.995><c> va</c><00:06:37.095><c> cambiando.</c>\n00:06:37.785 --> 00:06:37.795 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:35.795",
      "end": "00:06:37.785",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vemos ya que la cosa va cambiando.\nEntonces,<00:06:38.395><c> en</c><00:06:38.495><c> el</c><00:06:38.595><c> oro</c><00:06:38.795><c> la</c><00:06:38.895><c> cosa</c><00:06:39.095><c> es</c>\n00:06:39.285 --> 00:06:39.295 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:37.795",
      "end": "00:06:39.285",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entonces, en el oro la cosa es\ndiferente,<00:06:39.695><c> pero</c><00:06:39.895><c> sin</c><00:06:39.995><c> embargo</c><00:06:40.295><c> siguen</c>\n00:06:40.585 --> 00:06:40.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:39.295",
      "end": "00:06:40.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "diferente, pero sin embargo siguen\nsiendo<00:06:40.995><c> máximos</c><00:06:41.995><c> y</c><00:06:42.095><c> mínimos</c><00:06:42.595><c> decrecientes.</c><00:06:43.695><c> Y</c>\n00:06:44.285 --> 00:06:44.295 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:40.595",
      "end": "00:06:44.285",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "siendo máximos y mínimos decrecientes. Y\nyo<00:06:44.395><c> seguía</c><00:06:44.695><c> esta</c><00:06:44.895><c> mañana</c><00:06:45.295><c> la</c><00:06:45.495><c> proyección</c>\n00:06:45.885 --> 00:06:45.895 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:44.295",
      "end": "00:06:45.885",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "yo seguía esta mañana la proyección\nhacia<00:06:46.095><c> los</c><00:06:46.295><c> 3623.</c><00:06:47.795><c> ¿Qué</c><00:06:47.895><c> está</c><00:06:48.095><c> dejando</c><00:06:48.495><c> hoy?</c>\n00:06:48.885 --> 00:06:48.895 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:45.895",
      "end": "00:06:48.885",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hacia los 3623. ¿Qué está dejando hoy?\nLo<00:06:48.995><c> que</c><00:06:49.095><c> parece</c><00:06:49.495><c> ser</c><00:06:49.795><c> una</c><00:06:49.995><c> señal,</c><00:06:50.395><c> lo</c><00:06:50.495><c> tengo</c>\n00:06:50.685 --> 00:06:50.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:48.895",
      "end": "00:06:50.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lo que parece ser una señal, lo tengo\nque<00:06:50.795><c> abrir</c><00:06:50.995><c> mejor,</c><00:06:51.495><c> una</c><00:06:51.695><c> señal</c><00:06:52.495><c> de</c>\n00:06:52.685 --> 00:06:52.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:50.695",
      "end": "00:06:52.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que abrir mejor, una señal de\ncontinuidad<00:06:53.395><c> de</c><00:06:53.395><c> esta</c><00:06:53.695><c> reversión.</c><00:06:54.395><c> Lo</c><00:06:54.495><c> que</c>\n00:06:54.485 --> 00:06:54.495 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:52.695",
      "end": "00:06:54.485",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "continuidad de esta reversión. Lo que\npasa<00:06:54.795><c> que</c><00:06:55.395><c> el</c><00:06:55.595><c> contexto</c><00:06:55.995><c> es</c><00:06:55.995><c> diferente</c><00:06:56.495><c> al</c><00:06:56.595><c> que</c>\n00:06:56.685 --> 00:06:56.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:54.495",
      "end": "00:06:56.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pasa que el contexto es diferente al que\nyo<00:06:56.795><c> hablaba</c><00:06:57.095><c> antes</c><00:06:57.295><c> en</c><00:06:57.395><c> bitcoin</c><00:06:57.795><c> porque</c><00:06:58.095><c> es</c><00:06:58.395><c> en</c>\n00:06:58.585 --> 00:06:58.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:56.695",
      "end": "00:06:58.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "yo hablaba antes en bitcoin porque es en\nun<00:06:58.995><c> precio</c>\n00:07:00.185 --> 00:07:00.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:06:58.595",
      "end": "00:07:00.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "un precio\ndonde<00:07:00.395><c> pueden</c><00:07:00.795><c> han</c><00:07:00.895><c> aparecido</c><00:07:01.395><c> compras</c><00:07:01.795><c> a</c><00:07:01.795><c> un</c>\n00:07:01.885 --> 00:07:01.895 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:00.195",
      "end": "00:07:01.885",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "donde pueden han aparecido compras a un\nprecio<00:07:02.295><c> calculado.</c><00:07:02.995><c> Entonces,</c><00:07:03.495><c> el</c><00:07:03.695><c> contexto</c>\n00:07:04.085 --> 00:07:04.095 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:01.895",
      "end": "00:07:04.085",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio calculado. Entonces, el contexto\nes<00:07:04.195><c> muy</c><00:07:04.295><c> diferente</c><00:07:05.095><c> a</c><00:07:05.295><c> este</c><00:07:05.595><c> otro.</c><00:07:05.995><c> Aquí</c><00:07:06.295><c> está</c>\n00:07:06.485 --> 00:07:06.495 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:04.095",
      "end": "00:07:06.485",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "es muy diferente a este otro. Aquí está\nel<00:07:06.595><c> principio</c><00:07:07.395><c> de</c><00:07:07.495><c> una</c><00:07:07.895><c> corrección</c><00:07:08.595><c> y</c><00:07:08.695><c> el</c>\n00:07:08.785 --> 00:07:08.795 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:06.495",
      "end": "00:07:08.785",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el principio de una corrección y el\ncontexto<00:07:09.195><c> es</c><00:07:09.195><c> muy</c><00:07:09.295><c> diferente</c><00:07:09.695><c> y</c><00:07:09.795><c> este</c><00:07:09.995><c> es</c><00:07:09.995><c> de</c>\n00:07:10.085 --> 00:07:10.095 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:08.795",
      "end": "00:07:10.085",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "contexto es muy diferente y este es de\ncontinuidad.<00:07:11.095><c> Ese</c><00:07:11.395><c> otro</c><00:07:11.895><c> no</c><00:07:11.995><c> lo</c><00:07:12.095><c> tiene</c><00:07:12.395><c> por</c>\n00:07:12.485 --> 00:07:12.495 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:10.095",
      "end": "00:07:12.485",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "continuidad. Ese otro no lo tiene por\nqué<00:07:12.695><c> ser.</c><00:07:13.395><c> Bueno,</c><00:07:13.995><c> con</c><00:07:14.195><c> todo</c><00:07:14.495><c> ello</c><00:07:14.895><c> yo</c><00:07:14.995><c> creo</c>\n00:07:15.185 --> 00:07:15.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:12.495",
      "end": "00:07:15.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "qué ser. Bueno, con todo ello yo creo\nque<00:07:15.295><c> tenemos</c><00:07:16.095><c> información</c><00:07:16.695><c> suficiente.</c>\n00:07:17.185 --> 00:07:17.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:15.195",
      "end": "00:07:17.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que tenemos información suficiente.\nEntonces,<00:07:17.795><c> los</c><00:07:17.995><c> índices</c><00:07:18.395><c> están</c><00:07:18.695><c> también</c><00:07:19.095><c> de</c>\n00:07:19.185 --> 00:07:19.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:17.195",
      "end": "00:07:19.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entonces, los índices están también de\nla<00:07:19.295><c> misma</c><00:07:19.595><c> manera,</c><00:07:19.895><c> con</c><00:07:20.195><c> correcciones</c><00:07:20.695><c> en</c><00:07:21.095><c> la</c>\n00:07:21.185 --> 00:07:21.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:19.195",
      "end": "00:07:21.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "la misma manera, con correcciones en la\njornada<00:07:21.495><c> de</c><00:07:21.695><c> hoy</c><00:07:22.295><c> más</c><00:07:22.395><c> suaves</c><00:07:22.695><c> que</c><00:07:22.795><c> bitcoin</c>\n00:07:24.085 --> 00:07:24.095 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:21.195",
      "end": "00:07:24.085",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "jornada de hoy más suaves que bitcoin\ny<00:07:24.195><c> que</c><00:07:24.395><c> ethereum.</c>\n00:07:25.585 --> 00:07:25.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:24.095",
      "end": "00:07:25.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y que ethereum.\nEs\n00:07:26.685 --> 00:07:26.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:25.595",
      "end": "00:07:26.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Es\nno<00:07:26.895><c> adelantarse</c><00:07:27.795><c> y</c><00:07:27.895><c> tener</c><00:07:28.195><c> siempre</c><00:07:28.495><c> los</c>\n00:07:28.785 --> 00:07:28.795 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:26.695",
      "end": "00:07:28.785",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "no adelantarse y tener siempre los\nplanes<00:07:29.295><c> previstos,</c>\n00:07:30.685 --> 00:07:30.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:28.795",
      "end": "00:07:30.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "planes previstos,\nver<00:07:30.995><c> que</c><00:07:31.195><c> la</c><00:07:31.295><c> proyección</c>\n00:07:32.585 --> 00:07:32.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:30.695",
      "end": "00:07:32.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ver que la proyección\nno<00:07:32.895><c> se</c><00:07:33.095><c> ha</c><00:07:33.095><c> invalidado</c><00:07:33.995><c> el</c><00:07:34.095><c> escenario</c><00:07:34.595><c> y</c><00:07:34.595><c> la</c>\n00:07:34.685 --> 00:07:34.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:32.595",
      "end": "00:07:34.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "no se ha invalidado el escenario y la\nproyección,<00:07:35.695><c> actuar</c><00:07:36.095><c> siempre</c><00:07:36.495><c> con</c><00:07:36.695><c> plan,</c><00:07:37.295><c> no</c>\n00:07:37.685 --> 00:07:37.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:34.695",
      "end": "00:07:37.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "proyección, actuar siempre con plan, no\nactuar<00:07:38.295><c> precipitadamente,</c><00:07:39.295><c> no</c><00:07:39.395><c> con</c><00:07:39.695><c> FOMO,</c>\n00:07:40.285 --> 00:07:40.295 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:37.695",
      "end": "00:07:40.285",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "actuar precipitadamente, no con FOMO,\nporque<00:07:40.495><c> ayer</c><00:07:40.795><c> fuera</c><00:07:40.995><c> una</c><00:07:41.095><c> jornada</c><00:07:41.495><c> que</c><00:07:41.695><c> vimos</c>\n00:07:41.885 --> 00:07:41.895 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:40.295",
      "end": "00:07:41.885",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "porque ayer fuera una jornada que vimos\nel<00:07:41.995><c> precio</c><00:07:42.295><c> subir,</c><00:07:42.895><c> hoy</c><00:07:43.095><c> que</c><00:07:43.195><c> se</c><00:07:43.295><c> me</c><00:07:43.395><c> escapa.</c>\n00:07:44.685 --> 00:07:44.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:41.895",
      "end": "00:07:44.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el precio subir, hoy que se me escapa.\nEsto<00:07:44.895><c> está</c><00:07:45.095><c> cambiando.</c>\n00:07:46.385 --> 00:07:46.395 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:44.695",
      "end": "00:07:46.385",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Esto está cambiando.\nNo<00:07:46.595><c> está</c><00:07:46.795><c> manipulado,</c><00:07:47.395><c> está</c><00:07:47.595><c> en</c><00:07:47.795><c> zonas</c><00:07:48.095><c> de</c>\n00:07:48.185 --> 00:07:48.195 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:46.395",
      "end": "00:07:48.185",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "No está manipulado, está en zonas de\nventas.<00:07:49.095><c> Las</c><00:07:49.395><c> llevamos</c><00:07:49.795><c> manejando</c><00:07:50.395><c> todos</c>\n00:07:50.585 --> 00:07:50.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:48.195",
      "end": "00:07:50.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ventas. Las llevamos manejando todos\nestos<00:07:50.795><c> días</c><00:07:51.095><c> así.</c><00:07:51.395><c> Bueno,</c><00:07:51.695><c> esta</c><00:07:51.895><c> es</c><00:07:51.995><c> mi</c><00:07:52.095><c> visión</c>\n00:07:52.385 --> 00:07:52.395 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:50.595",
      "end": "00:07:52.385",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estos días así. Bueno, esta es mi visión\nde<00:07:52.495><c> mercado.</c>\n00:07:53.685 --> 00:07:53.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:52.395",
      "end": "00:07:53.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de mercado.\nEntonces,<00:07:53.995><c> espero</c><00:07:54.395><c> que</c><00:07:54.495><c> con</c><00:07:54.695><c> esta</c><00:07:54.895><c> reflexión,</c>\n00:07:55.685 --> 00:07:55.695 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:53.695",
      "end": "00:07:55.685",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entonces, espero que con esta reflexión,\nsiempre<00:07:55.995><c> es</c><00:07:55.995><c> buena</c><00:07:56.295><c> para</c><00:07:56.495><c> acabar</c><00:07:56.795><c> la</c><00:07:56.895><c> jornada,</c>\n00:07:57.985 --> 00:07:57.995 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:55.695",
      "end": "00:07:57.985",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "siempre es buena para acabar la jornada,\ndarle<00:07:58.295><c> una</c><00:07:58.395><c> vuelta</c><00:07:59.295><c> a</c><00:07:59.395><c> ver</c><00:07:59.495><c> si</c><00:07:59.795><c> también</c><00:08:00.195><c> a</c><00:08:00.295><c> ti</c>\n00:08:00.385 --> 00:08:00.395 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:07:57.995",
      "end": "00:08:00.385",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "darle una vuelta a ver si también a ti\nte<00:08:00.595><c> cuadra.</c><00:08:01.195><c> Mañana</c><00:08:01.595><c> viernes</c><00:08:02.095><c> con</c><00:08:02.295><c> un</c><00:08:02.395><c> solo</c>\n00:08:02.585 --> 00:08:02.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:00.395",
      "end": "00:08:02.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "te cuadra. Mañana viernes con un solo\nvídeo<00:08:03.395><c> haremos</c><00:08:03.995><c> porque</c><00:08:04.295><c> mañana</c><00:08:04.695><c> hay</c><00:08:04.795><c> nóminas</c>\n00:08:05.285 --> 00:08:05.295 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:02.595",
      "end": "00:08:05.285",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vídeo haremos porque mañana hay nóminas\nno<00:08:05.395><c> agrícolas</c><00:08:05.795><c> y</c><00:08:05.895><c> vamos</c><00:08:06.095><c> a</c><00:08:06.095><c> ver</c><00:08:06.295><c> cómo</c><00:08:06.495><c> se</c>\n00:08:06.585 --> 00:08:06.595 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:05.295",
      "end": "00:08:06.585",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "no agrícolas y vamos a ver cómo se\ncomporta<00:08:07.195><c> y</c><00:08:07.197><c> después</c><00:08:07.397><c> el</c><00:08:07.497><c> sábado</c><00:08:07.797><c> hablaremos</c>\n00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:08.297 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:06.595",
      "end": "00:08:08.287",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "comporta y después el sábado hablaremos\nde<00:08:08.397><c> ella.</c>\n00:08:09.287 --> 00:08:09.297 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:08.297",
      "end": "00:08:09.287",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de ella.\nEspero<00:08:09.597><c> haber</c><00:08:09.797><c> aportado</c><00:08:10.197><c> ese</c><00:08:10.397><c> 1%</c><00:08:11.397><c> en</c><00:08:12.197><c> en</c><00:08:12.397><c> esta</c>\n00:08:12.887 --> 00:08:12.897 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:09.297",
      "end": "00:08:12.887",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Espero haber aportado ese 1% en en esta\nparte,\n00:08:13.887 --> 00:08:13.897 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:12.897",
      "end": "00:08:13.887",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "parte,\nque<00:08:13.997><c> puedas</c><00:08:14.197><c> ver</c><00:08:14.297><c> los</c><00:08:14.497><c> mercados</c><00:08:15.797><c> de</c><00:08:15.997><c> tal</c>\n00:08:16.187 --> 00:08:16.197 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:13.897",
      "end": "00:08:16.187",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que puedas ver los mercados de tal\nmanera<00:08:16.497><c> de</c><00:08:16.597><c> que</c><00:08:16.797><c> puedas</c><00:08:17.097><c> hacerlo</c><00:08:17.997><c> más</c><00:08:18.997><c> y</c><00:08:19.097><c> mejor</c>\n00:08:19.887 --> 00:08:19.897 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:16.197",
      "end": "00:08:19.887",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "manera de que puedas hacerlo más y mejor\ny<00:08:20.097><c> que</c><00:08:20.297><c> pueda</c><00:08:20.897><c> traerte</c>\n00:08:21.987 --> 00:08:21.997 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:19.897",
      "end": "00:08:21.987",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y que pueda traerte\nmás<00:08:22.297><c> cosas</c><00:08:22.797><c> buenas</c><00:08:23.497><c> que</c><00:08:23.697><c> malas.</c><00:08:24.497><c> Más</c><00:08:24.697><c> y</c><00:08:24.697><c> mejor.</c>\n00:08:25.487 --> 00:08:25.497 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:08:21.997",
      "end": "00:08:25.487",
      "source": "DnwM-2nuS4s.es.vtt"
    }
  ],
  "full_text": "Saludos<00:00:00.600><c> cordiales.</c><00:00:01.200><c> Bienvenida,</c>\n00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:02.200 align:start position:0% Saludos cordiales. Bienvenida,\nbienvenido.\n00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:03.900 align:start position:0% bienvenido.\nPues<00:00:04.200><c> estamos</c><00:00:04.600><c> viendo</c><00:00:05.100><c> en</c><00:00:05.200><c> la</c><00:00:05.300><c> actualización</c>\n00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:05.900 align:start position:0% Pues estamos viendo en la actualización\nde<00:00:06.000><c> bitcoin</c><00:00:06.400><c> hoy,</c><00:00:06.900><c> 5</c><00:00:07.400><c> de</c><00:00:07.500><c> noviembre.</c>\n00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:09.000 align:start position:0% de bitcoin hoy, 5 de noviembre.\nEn<00:00:09.100><c> este</c><00:00:09.200><c> momento</c><00:00:09.600><c> ya</c><00:00:09.800><c> son</c><00:00:10.000><c> las</c><00:00:10.700><c> eh</c><00:00:11.300><c> 7</c><00:00:11.900><c> y</c><00:00:12.200><c> 20</c><00:00:12.700><c> de</c>\n00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.000 align:start position:0% En este momento ya son las eh 7 y 20 de\ncasi<00:00:13.300><c> 20</c><00:00:13.700><c> minutos</c><00:00:14.000><c> de</c><00:00:14.100><c> la</c><00:00:14.200><c> tarde,</c>\n00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:15.400 align:start position:0% casi 20 minutos de la tarde,\nuna<00:00:15.500><c> horita</c><00:00:15.900><c> menos</c><00:00:16.100><c> en</c><00:00:16.200><c> Canarias,</c><00:00:16.600><c> donde</c><00:00:16.900><c> yo</c>\n00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.000 align:start position:0% una horita menos en Canarias, donde yo\nresido.\n00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:18.200 align:start position:0% resido.\nHoy<00:00:18.400><c> cuando</c>\n00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.000 align:start position:0% Hoy cuando\nestaba<00:00:20.700><c> preparando</c><00:00:21.100><c> las</c><00:00:21.200><c> cosas</c><00:00:21.400><c> esta</c><00:00:21.600><c> tarde</c>\n00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:21.800 align:start position:0% estaba preparando las cosas esta tarde\ndije,<00:00:22.400><c> hoy</c><00:00:22.500><c> no</c><00:00:22.700><c> me</c><00:00:22.800><c> apetece</c><00:00:23.200><c> mucho</c><00:00:23.500><c> hacer</c><00:00:23.800><c> este</c>\n00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:24.400 align:start position:0% dije, hoy no me apetece mucho hacer este\nel<00:00:24.600><c> segundo</c><00:00:25.000><c> vídeo,</c><00:00:25.600><c> en</c><00:00:25.700><c> fin,</c><00:00:26.400><c> pensé</c><00:00:26.700><c> que</c><00:00:26.800><c> iba</c>\n00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:26.900 align:start position:0% el segundo vídeo, en fin, pensé que iba\na<00:00:27.000><c> estar</c><00:00:27.800><c> como</c><00:00:28.000><c> lo</c><00:00:28.100><c> dejamos</c><00:00:28.400><c> metido</c><00:00:28.700><c> ahí</c><00:00:28.800><c> en</c><00:00:28.800><c> un</c>\n00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:28.900 align:start position:0% a estar como lo dejamos metido ahí en un\nrango<00:00:29.200><c> apoyado,</c><00:00:29.700><c> yo</c><00:00:29.900><c> decía,</c><00:00:30.200><c> a</c><00:00:30.300><c> ver</c><00:00:30.500><c> quién</c>\n00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:31.800 align:start position:0% rango apoyado, yo decía, a ver quién\nquién<00:00:31.900><c> le</c><00:00:32.000><c> da</c><00:00:32.200><c> a</c><00:00:32.200><c> las</c><00:00:32.400><c> pataditas</c><00:00:32.800><c> a</c><00:00:32.800><c> la</c><00:00:33.000><c> pelota,</c>\n00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:33.300 align:start position:0% quién le da a las pataditas a la pelota,\nsi<00:00:33.500><c> alcistas</c><00:00:33.900><c> o</c><00:00:33.900><c> bajistas.</c><00:00:34.800><c> Bueno,</c><00:00:35.200><c> ¿quién</c><00:00:35.400><c> se</c>\n00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:35.500 align:start position:0% si alcistas o bajistas. Bueno, ¿quién se\nla<00:00:35.600><c> ha</c><00:00:35.600><c> dado?</c>\n00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:36.700 align:start position:0% la ha dado?\nYo<00:00:36.800><c> yo</c><00:00:36.900><c> pensé,</c><00:00:37.600><c> pues</c><00:00:37.700><c> no</c><00:00:37.900><c> voy</c><00:00:38.100><c> a</c><00:00:38.100><c> hacer</c><00:00:38.400><c> el</c>\n00:00:38.490 -->